const FLANK_YEAR = 4;
// From this year on, the Sachsen bring their own mounted knights too — reusing the same
// "enemyKnight" sprite/toughness the Delegation's knights use during a Fehde.
const KNIGHT_YEAR = 8;
// The Schmiede's two research tiers: how much they boost defenders' combat damage, and how
// much more expensive every soldier/archer/champion becomes to keep paid at that standard of
// equipment. Tier 1 only needs the Schmiede itself; tier 2 also needs the Waffenschmied
